ECLIPSE four-level integration patch

Files in this ZIP replace/add only:
- main.py: sequence controller for Level 1 -> Level 2 -> Level 3 -> Level 4
- level2.py: removes the old placeholder Level 3 hook; Continue returns to main.py
- level4.py: prevents display creation as a side effect of importing Level 4

Use with the other existing project files in the same folder:
level1.py, level3.py, entities.py, puzzle.py, settings.py, ui.py.

Run from the project root:
    python main.py

Keep a backup or commit your current work before replacing files.

